{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12111170","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12111170","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1211117001:0":{"text":"우리가 호드킨을 처치하다니... 우리가 호드킨을 처치했어!","source_cn":"我们打败了霍德希金……真不敢相信！我们居然打败了霍德希金！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0764621CF9F39C27","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1211117002:0":{"text":"호드킨은 죽음의 함대를 이끄는 대해적이라고!","source_cn":"那可是率领着死潮舰队的大海盗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECC5E53B3E3F8FE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1211117003:0":{"text":"신밧드, 호드킨이 유령으로 변할 수 있다는 말은 없었잖아요?","source_cn":"辛巴达，你从来没说过霍德希金还能变成幽灵啊？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x628BEA38749AE184","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1211117004:0":{"text":"응? 무슨 유령?","source_cn":"啊？什么幽灵？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08A5AEE4C6F39471","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1211117005:0":{"text":"조금 전에 우리와 싸웠던 그 호드킨은 유령 아닌가요?","source_cn":"刚刚和我们战斗的霍德希金，不是个幽灵吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E70923F9EB21882","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_stat